        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:var(--ink)">The warmth</strong> reaches deep and steady — like sinking your knee into a hot bath that never goes lukewarm. Blood flow lifts, the joint relaxes.</p>
